info
# Issue #1993: a dead dispatched worker whose death was classified as a
# provider throttle (rate_limited / quota_exhausted) sat past the timed-reap
# grace with no linked PR. The issue is already back in the dispatchable pool,
# so the backstop re-armed its clock instead of escalating. Bounded by
# watchdog.max_auto_redispatch; past that, dead_dispatched_worker_reaped fires.
